# SAFETY (2026-08-16): this repo is PUBLIC and deploys to GitHub Pages.
# The app writes its backup/export files straight into this folder, and those
# contain Linh's real patient names, prescriptions and dispense history.
# They were sitting here untracked -- one `git add -A` away from being
# published. These patterns keep that from ever happening by accident.
#
# The app itself (index.html, manifest.json, sw.js, icons/) is committed
# normally; only DATA is ignored here.
LCM-pharmacy-*.json
LCM-pharmacy-*.csv
*-before-restore*.json
*-before-update*.json
task.json

# local scratch
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
